<Slide>
  <Box style={{position: 'relative', width: '100%', height: '100%', overflow: 'hidden', background: '#FFFFFF'}}>
    {/* Full-height image, right 55% */}
    <Box style={{position: 'absolute', top: 0, right: 0, width: 620, height: 720, overflow: 'hidden'}}>
      <Image src="assets/whatsapp_ai.png" style={{width: '100%', height: '100%', objectFit: 'cover'}} />
      <Box style={{position: 'absolute', left: 0, top: 0, width: 6, height: 720, background: '#0072BC'}} />
    </Box>

    {/* Riding text block */}
    <Box style={{position: 'absolute', left: 64, top: 32, width: 620, height: 656, zIndex: 1, justifyContent: 'space-between'}}>
      <Box>
        <Box style={{height: 88, flexDirection: 'row', alignItems: 'flex-start', gap: 12}}>
          <Box style={{width: 4, height: 40, background: '#0072BC', marginTop: 4}} />
          <Box style={{flex: 1}}>
            <Text style={{fontSize: 34, fontWeight: 700, color: '#0F2C4D', lineHeight: 1.3}}>值班群里的智能助手</Text>
            <Text style={{fontSize: 16, fontWeight: 400, color: '#64748B', marginTop: 6}}>
              过去只存在于当班最有经验那个人脑子里的知识。
            </Text>
          </Box>
        </Box>

        <Box style={{marginTop: 20}}>
          <Text style={{fontSize: 18, fontWeight: 700, color: '#0F2C4D'}}>直接问它问题</Text>
          <Text style={{fontSize: 15, fontWeight: 400, color: '#64748B', marginTop: 6, lineHeight: 1.5}}>
            在群里 @ 它提问，它依据运维知识库作答——告警规则、工单级别规则、
            派单规则、平台操作手册；资料里没有的，它会明说没有。
          </Text>
        </Box>

        <Box style={{marginTop: 18}}>
          <Text style={{fontSize: 18, fontWeight: 700, color: '#0F2C4D'}}>或者发一个工单号</Text>
          <Text style={{fontSize: 15, fontWeight: 400, color: '#64748B', marginTop: 6, lineHeight: 1.5}}>
            它返回这张单的级别、命中了哪条规则、判定依据、派单依据、完整处理
            链路和 SLA 状态——中文提问中文答，英文提问英文答。
          </Text>
        </Box>

        <Box style={{marginTop: 18}}>
          <Text style={{fontSize: 18, fontWeight: 700, color: '#0F2C4D'}}>本地还没有这单时</Text>
          <Text style={{fontSize: 15, fontWeight: 400, color: '#64748B', marginTop: 6, lineHeight: 1.5}}>
            若工单尚未同步到本地库，它会先说明，再改去源头实时查询，并在回复里
            标明这条答案来自哪里。
          </Text>
        </Box>
      </Box>

      {/* Evidence bar */}
      <Box style={{background: '#0F2C4D', borderRadius: 10, padding: 20}}>
        <Box style={{flexDirection: 'row', justifyContent: 'space-between', alignItems: 'flex-start'}}>
          <Box>
            <Text style={{fontSize: 38, fontWeight: 900, color: '#FF922B', lineHeight: 1}}>100%</Text>
            <Text style={{fontSize: 12, color: 'rgba(255,255,255,0.7)', marginTop: 6}}>可确认项上派单<br />归因全部正确</Text>
          </Box>
          <Box>
            <Text style={{fontSize: 38, fontWeight: 900, color: '#FFFFFF', lineHeight: 1}}>99.2%</Text>
            <Text style={{fontSize: 12, color: 'rgba(255,255,255,0.7)', marginTop: 6}}>的工单能给出<br />具名规则解释</Text>
          </Box>
          <Box>
            <Text style={{fontSize: 38, fontWeight: 900, color: '#FFFFFF', lineHeight: 1}}>500</Text>
            <Text style={{fontSize: 12, color: 'rgba(255,255,255,0.7)', marginTop: 6}}>张工单现场<br />回归验证</Text>
          </Box>
        </Box>
        <Text style={{fontSize: 13, fontWeight: 400, color: 'rgba(255,255,255,0.6)', marginTop: 14, lineHeight: 1.45}}>
          知识库在本机向量化、本机检索，文档不出机器。
        </Text>
      </Box>
    </Box>

    {/* Footer (left of image) */}
    <Box style={{position: 'absolute', left: 64, bottom: 20, width: 596, flexDirection: 'row', justifyContent: 'space-between', alignItems: 'center', borderTop: '1px solid #E2E8F0', paddingTop: 8, zIndex: 1}}>
      <Text style={{fontSize: 14, color: '#94A3B8'}}>OLR MS 运维工具平台</Text>
      <Text style={{fontSize: 14, color: '#94A3B8'}}>15 / 17</Text>
    </Box>
  </Box>
</Slide>
